      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXAGGERATOR (4) has a strong record this trip with six wins and two placings from 14 starts. Missed the frame latest (23.87) when fourth over 410m at Horsham in a Grade 5. Looks suited and should go close. ASCEND HIBISCUS (1) fast out of the inside draw with a slick early sectional and clocking 22.15 in a 2 length win at this track over 390m last time. Is yet to taste defeat in four starts from this draw. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. MARKET JET (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 2.75 lengths away in third (22.34) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can measure up. GO MY SWIFTY (3) form at this course and distance reads well.",
